            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2TI.3.15+2TI.3.16+2TI.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tim 3:15-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Musherura munonga omu Byahandiikirwe, ahakuba muteekateeka ngu omuribyo nimwo mwine amagara agatahwaho; haza kandi ebyo nibyo bimpamya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka mwanga kwija ahariinye, ngu muheebwe amagara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tindikwikiriza kitiinisa eki ndikuheebwa abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahakuba nimmanya imwe ku mutarikukunda Ruhanga omu mitima yaanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyizire omu iziina rya Tata, timwanyakiira; ondiijo ku ariija omu iziina rye wenka, we muryamwakiira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.12.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 12:43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nimubaasa muta kwikiriza, imwe abahaana ekitiinisa, haza mutasherura kitiinisa ekiruga ahari Ruhanga omwe wenka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.31.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 31:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Murekye kugira ngu niinye ndibarega ahari Tata; hariho omwe obarega, niwe Musa, ou mwesiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.18.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 18:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kuri mwaikiriize Musa, naanye mukaanyikiriize, ahakuba niinye yaahandiikireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.7.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 7:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku muraabe mutaikiriza bi yaahandiikire, muryabaasa muta kwikiriza ebigambo byangye?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.47"
            ]
          }
        }
